{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a private hybrid setup: your on-prem data center connects via Express Connect to a Jakarta VPC hosting MongoDB and RDS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Databases stay in Jakarta region only","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","mongodb","rds","privatezone"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises data center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"App servers","group":"onprem","why":"Runs SaaS application servers in your own facility."}
{"t":"group","id":"jakarta","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Private DB VPC","parent":"jakarta"}
{"t":"node","id":"ec","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"vpc","why":"Dedicated private link from data center to Jakarta VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-ec","from":"dc","to":"ec","label":"private"}
{"t":"node","id":"mongo","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Document store for the SaaS platform, private only."}
{"t":"node","id":"rds","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational store for the SaaS platform, private only."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-mongo","from":"ec","to":"mongo","label":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-rds","from":"ec","to":"rds","label":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"privatezone","label":"PrivateZone","group":"vpc","attachTo":"vpc","why":"Resolves database endpoints privately inside the VPC."}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-prem app servers reach managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL in Jakarta over Express Connect with no public exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design your live-streaming platform with strong DDoS defense. Note: ESA must sit before Anti-DDoS Proxy per architecture rules."}
{"t":"req","text":"Strong DDoS and attack defense for live streaming"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","anti-ddos-proxy","alb","waf","ecs","tair","oss","live","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers","group":"internet","why":"Audience watching live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves platform domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge Defense","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches content, provides built-in DDoS defense and edge acceleration."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubbing large L3-L7 attacks behind ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-ddos","from":"esa","to":"ddos","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across app servers."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots at load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ddos-alb","from":"ddos","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App Servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs streaming platform backend logic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and stream metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding ApsaraVideo Live for stream processing, OSS for recordings, and SLS for centralized logging."}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and delivers live video streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-live","from":"app","to":"live","label":"stream"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Recordings","group":"sg","why":"Stores recorded streams and static assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"record"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and security alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming platform with ESA fronting Anti-DDoS Proxy, ALB with WAF, ECS app servers, Tair cache, and ApsaraVideo Live."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Qwen via Model Studio and reading company docs from OSS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","model-studio","oss","rds","tair","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Internal staff querying the knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the internal assistant domain to ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"fra","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"fra"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes employee HTTPS traffic into the cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Managed Kubernetes hosting the Dify workloads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify on ACK","group":"vpc","why":"Self-hosted low-code agent and RAG builder for the assistant."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-dify","from":"ack","to":"dify"}
{"t":"say","text":"Dify calls Qwen through Model Studio and reads your documents from OSS for retrieval-augmented generation."}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"fra","why":"Hosts Qwen models that Dify calls for inference."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-llm","from":"dify","to":"llm","label":"API"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Company Docs","group":"fra","why":"Stores company documents that Dify ingests for RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-docs","from":"dify","to":"docs","label":"read"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Dify Metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Persists Dify workflows, users and app metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-db","from":"dify","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and vector lookups for fast responses."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-cache","from":"dify","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"fra","why":"Collects Dify and ACK logs for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-logs","from":"dify","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt with ALB ingress, Model Studio for Qwen, OSS for docs, RDS and Tair."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a product catalog API with ESA, ALB, SAE compute, RDS database, Tair cache and OSS for images."}
{"t":"req","text":"Avoid Elasticsearch due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","sae","rds","tair","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace shoppers","group":"internet","why":"Customers browsing the product catalog."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the marketplace domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates API responses and caches product images at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes API requests across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the catalog API from attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"sae","label":"Catalog API","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the product catalog API serverlessly."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-api","from":"alb","to":"api","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Product cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches hot product data for fast reads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Catalog DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores products, categories and pricing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product photos served via ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-images","from":"api","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"API logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes API access and error logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API on SAE behind ESA and ALB with WAF, RDS, Tair cache and OSS image storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add OpenSearch for fast full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions, respecting the Elasticsearch ban."}
{"t":"req","text":"Avoid Elasticsearch due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"opensearch","label":"Product search","group":"vpc","why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-search","from":"api","to":"search","label":"query"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added OpenSearch node for full-text and fuzzy product search behind the Catalog API, avoiding Elasticsearch as required."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind an ALB, RDS for metadata and OSS for images, no Function Compute."}
{"t":"req","text":"No serverless functions allowed","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App users","group":"internet","why":"People uploading and viewing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches photos and accelerates uploads globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes HTTP traffic to ECS instances across zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the API from injection and bot attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing backend on managed VMs."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales ECS instances during traffic spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Metadata goes to RDS and images to OSS, both highly available."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Photo metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data, photo tags and metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Photo storage","group":"sg","why":"Durable object storage for uploaded images."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"serve"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logging for debugging and monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend with ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, RDS and OSS, no serverless functions."}

{"t":"say","text":"Since Function Compute is forbidden, I'll add a Kafka topic and an ECS worker pool to generate thumbnails from OSS events."}
{"t":"req","text":"No serverless functions allowed","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"node","id":"queue","product":"kafka","label":"Thumbnail queue","group":"vpc","why":"Receives OSS upload events for async thumbnail processing."}
{"t":"node","id":"worker","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail workers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Consumes queue messages and generates image thumbnails."}
{"t":"node","id":"thumbs","product":"oss","label":"Thumbnails bucket","group":"sg","why":"Stores generated thumbnails served by ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-images-queue","from":"images","to":"queue","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-queue-worker","from":"queue","to":"worker","label":"consume","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-worker-thumbs","from":"worker","to":"thumbs","label":"write"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-thumbs","from":"esa","to":"thumbs","label":"serve"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added Kafka queue and ECS thumbnail workers that read OSS events and write thumbnails to a second OSS bucket."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a claims portal in Tokyo (ap-northeast-1) so all policyholder data stays in Japan, as required."}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","kms"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"Insurance customers submitting claims and documents."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the claims portal domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates portal access with built-in DDoS protection."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes HTTPS traffic across two Tokyo zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the claims form from injection and bots."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Hosts the claims web application in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales servers during peak claim periods."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Claim metadata goes to RDS and uploaded documents to OSS, both encrypted with KMS."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores claim records with a zone standby in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Claim documents","group":"tokyo","why":"Stores policyholder uploads like photos and PDFs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"objects"}
{"t":"node","id":"kms","product":"kms","label":"KMS","group":"tokyo","why":"Encrypts database and document storage at rest."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-kms","from":"db","to":"kms","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-kms","from":"docs","to":"kms","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"Central audit logs for compliance and troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Tokyo-only claims portal with ESA, ALB+WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, RDS, OSS and KMS encryption."}

{"t":"say","text":"Data residency requires all policyholder data to stay in Tokyo, so I cannot replicate the claims database to Singapore."}
{"t":"say","text":"Instead, the analytics team can access dashboards via a read-only portal served from Tokyo over ESA for low latency."}
{"t":"node","id":"analytics-users","product":"users","label":"Analytics team","group":"internet","why":"Singapore analysts viewing reports."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-analytics-users-dns","from":"analytics-users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-analytics-users-esa","from":"analytics-users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"read-replica","product":"rds","label":"Read replica","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Read-only DB copy for reporting queries."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-read-replica","from":"db","to":"read-replica","label":"replication","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"reporting-app","product":"ecs","label":"Reporting servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Serves dashboards from the read replica."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-reporting-app","from":"alb","to":"reporting-app","label":"reports"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-reporting-app-read-replica","from":"reporting-app","to":"read-replica","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Cannot replicate to Singapore due to Japan data residency; added a Tokyo read replica and reporting app accessible via ESA instead."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Qwen chatbot to the portal. Model Studio runs in Tokyo, so all data stays in Japan."}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen chatbot","group":"tokyo","why":"Answers policyholder questions via Qwen model APIs in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-llm","from":"app","to":"llm","label":"LLM API"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added Model Studio (Qwen) node in Tokyo and an edge from portal servers to it for the chatbot."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 데이터를 서울 리전에 배치하고, ESA와 ALB 뒤 게임 서버를 구성하겠습니다."}
{"t":"req","text":"이용자 개인정보는 반드시 한국(서울)에 보관해야 함","regions":["ap-northeast-2"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"인터넷","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"플레이어","group":"internet","why":"게임에 접속하는 이용자"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"게임 도메인을 ESA로 해석"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"엣지","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"정적 자산 캐싱 및 DDoS 방어"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"seoul","kind":"region","label":"Seoul (ap-northeast-2)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"게임 VPC","parent":"seoul"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 가용영역으로 트래픽 분산"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"웹 공격 및 봇 차단"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"game-server","product":"ecs","label":"게임 서버","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"서울 리전에서 게임 로직 처리"}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"game-server","why":"접속자 수에 따라 서버 자동 증설"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-game-server","from":"alb","to":"game-server"}
{"t":"say","text":"세션은 Tair에, 플레이어 데이터는 RDS에 저장하며 모두 서울 리전 두 가용영역에 구성합니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"세션 캐시","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"게임 세션과 랭킹 빠른 조회"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"플레이어 DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"개인정보 포함 플레이어 데이터 저장"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-server-cache","from":"game-server","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-server-db","from":"game-server","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"assets","product":"oss","label":"게임 에셋 스토리지","group":"seoul","why":"패치 파일 및 미디어 저장"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-assets","from":"esa","to":"assets","label":"assets"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"로그 서비스","group":"seoul","why":"서버 로그 수집 및 모니터링"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-server-logs","from":"game-server","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"서울 리전에 모든 데이터를 배치한 게임 아키텍처: ESA, ALB(WAF), ECS 게임 서버, Tair, RDS, OSS, SLS 구성."}

{"t":"say","text":"개인정보보호법 요건에 따라 플레이어 데이터는 서울 리전에만 보관해야 하므로, 프랑크푸르트 복제는 불가합니다."}
{"t":"say","text":"대신 ESA의 글로벌 엣지 가속을 활용해 유럽 유저의 지연 시간을 줄이는 것을 권장합니다."}
{"t":"done","summary":"데이터 반출 금지 요건으로 인해 프랑크푸르트 복제 대신 ESA 글로벌 가속으로 유럽 지연 시간 개선을 안내함."}

